OL,3,GNEWSATrain line closures cause major
OL,4,Adisruption
OL,5,
OL,6,FRail passengers in East and West Sussex
OL,7,Fare being warned of major disruption
OL,8,Fafter all lines between Brighton and
OL,9,FHaywards Heath were closed on Monday
OL,10,Fmorning.
OL,12,FSouthern Railway says the stations in
OL,13,FBalcombe, Hayward Heath, Wivelsfield,
OL,14,FBurgess Hill, Hassocks, Preston Park,
OL,15,FPlumpton and Cooksbridge will not be
OL,16,Fserved until further notice after a
OL,17,Fperson was hit by a train at about
OL,18,F07:00 GMT.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,329,320,200,140,0,100
