OL,3,GNEWSATrain line closures cause major
OL,4,Adisruption
OL,5,
OL,6,FTrains that normally run between both
OL,7,FEastbourne and Ore and London Victoria
OL,8,Fvia Plumpton and Cooksbridge have been
OL,9,Fsuspended.
OL,11,FNational Rail says it is expecting
OL,12,Fmajor disruption to services to last
OL,13,Funtil about 16:30.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
